---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const updated = 'September 25, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Post and Board Media"
  description="How Post and Board Media collects and uses the information you send through this website’s enquiry forms."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]}
>
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container--narrow prose">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="owner-review">
        <strong>Draft for owner review.</strong> This notice describes how the website currently works. It has not been
        reviewed by a lawyer and does not guarantee compliance with PIPEDA, Ontario law or CASL. Items marked “Owner
        review” need a decision before launch.
      </p>
      <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by {site.name}, an owner-operated business run by {site.owner}.
        {site.contact.email ? <> You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</> : ' Contact details are provided on our contact page.'}
      </p>
      <p class="owner-review">Owner review: confirm the legal business name, registration and a privacy contact email.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect what you choose to send us through our forms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Advertiser enquiries:</strong> your name, business name, email and target area, plus anything optional you add — advertising format, business category, website, phone, budget range, preferred timing, message and any opportunity you selected.</li>
        <li><strong>Host enquiries:</strong> venue name, contact name, email, area, venue type, and optionally a website and message.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical context:</strong> the page you sent the form from and the time it was sent.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The website does not use analytics, advertising trackers or marketing cookies. Fonts are served from our own
        website rather than a third party.
      </p>
      <p class="owner-review">Owner review: update this section if analytics, a chat tool or other third-party scripts are added later.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry and prepare quotes or proposals you ask for.</li>
        <li>To plan where campaigns and placements are needed.</li>
        <li>If you tick the optional box, to email you when new opportunities open in your area. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don’t sell your information, and we don’t add you to marketing emails unless you opt in separately.</p>

      <h2>Where it goes</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a form, the website’s server passes your enquiry to our workflow automation service (n8n), which
        forwards it to our inbox or records. Our hosting provider may keep short-term
        technical logs, such as IP addresses, for security and troubleshooting.
      </p>
      <p class="owner-review">
        Owner review: name the hosting provider, where the n8n instance is hosted, which services the workflow sends
        enquiries to (e.g. email, spreadsheets), and whether any of them store data outside Canada.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p class="owner-review">Owner review: set a retention period for enquiries that don’t proceed, and for client records.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see, correct or delete the information you’ve sent us, or withdraw consent to optional emails, by
        contacting us.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change how we handle information, we’ll update this page and the date above.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
